namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIPlayTween:EaseCurve {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/PlayTween/DreamUIPlayTween.h#DreamUIPlayTween:EaseCurve
    src   "only valid if easeType=CurveFloat"
    text  "仅在 easeType 为 CurveFloat 时有效。如果循环类型不是一次，则每当循环结束时，此事件都会被调用，参数为“循环完成次数”。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIPlayTween:LoopCount {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/PlayTween/DreamUIPlayTween.h#DreamUIPlayTween:LoopCount
    src   "Number of cycles to play; -1 for infinite.\n\nOne, not infinite. The default used to be -1, which is invisible until the author picks a loop\ntype -- and then the tween never ends: it is never taken out of the manager, it holds this play\ntween and the widget behind it for the rest of the run, a sequence component waiting on its\nOnComplete never advances past it, and a sequence refuses it outright\n(UDreamTweenerSequence::Insert). \"Loop forever\" is a thing to ask for, not a thing to get by\nnot asking. Assets saved before this change that left the field alone come back as 1."
    text  "要播放的循环次数；-1表示无限。\n\n是1，不是无限。默认值原本是-1，在作者选择循环类型之前看不出来——\n而一旦选定，补间就永不结束：它永远不会被从管理器中移除，会在本次运行的剩余时间里一直持有这个播放\n补间及其背后的控件；等待其OnComplete的序列组件永远不会越过它，\n而序列会直接拒绝它（UDreamTweenerSequence::Insert）。\n“永久循环”是应当主动要求的东西，而不是因为没有要求就能得到的东西。\n在此更改之前保存、未改动该字段的资产，恢复为1。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIPlayTween:OnCycleComplete {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/PlayTween/DreamUIPlayTween.h#DreamUIPlayTween:OnCycleComplete
    src   "if LoopType is not Once, then this will be called every time when the cycle end, with parameter \"cycle complete count\"."
    text  "如果循环类型不是“一次”，则每当循环结束时，此函数会被调用，参数为“循环完成次数”。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIPlayTween:OnUpdateProgress {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/PlayTween/DreamUIPlayTween.h#DreamUIPlayTween:OnUpdateProgress
    src   "parameter float is the progress in range 0-1, not affected by ease type (linear on time)"
    text  "参数 float 表示进度，范围为 0-1，不受缓动类型影响（按时间线性）。"
    state machine
}

